2770	  /// that finalizes to `complete`/`failed` must stop ticking forever
2771	  /// after, both so a long-lived chat session never leaks one live
2772	  /// `AnimationController` per past message, and so nothing waiting on
2773	  /// "every animation in the tree has settled" (e.g. a test's own
2774	  /// `pumpAndSettle()`) ever blocks on a bubble that finished streaming.
2775	  void _syncCursorAnimation() {
2776	    final shouldAnimate = widget.message.status == ChatMessageStatus.streaming;
